  (text "Nanotec PD2-C4118L1804-E-01 is a proposal. It is not released.\nThis order code is USB, not Modbus. USB is a service plug.\nClock and direction are not DIO pins. U2 is TODO.\nThe enable bit is DIO output 6.\nThe index sensor is B1 on sheet 05.\n24 V is inside the 12 V to 48 V range." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 10.16 12.70 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "87f4912b-8654-5c6c-ba95-95205473fb29"))
